msgid "Whether to add shell integration to bash, zsh and fish"
msgstr ""

#: src/com.aripd.Pano.gschema.xml:837
msgid ""
"If true, the default shell of a profile is started so that it reports its "
"prompts, commands and working directory, which command notifications, prompt "
"navigation and copying command output need. Custom commands, login bash "
"shells and terminals in containers are left alone."
